# Caddyfile — every host on this box. Put live ONLY with ops/caddy-apply.sh (validate → dated copy → in-place write → reload).
# Hosts whose DNS does not point here yet stay commented out: Caddy would keep retrying their certificates.
# Container names below (app1-app, app1-rest …) are the `edge` network aliases set in each app's docker-compose.yml.
{
	email ops@example.com
	# First rehearsal: use the staging CA (no rate limits, untrusted certificates), then remove this line and apply again.
	# acme_ca https://acme-staging-v02.api.letsencrypt.org/directory
